\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec3 In particular, the relationship between the sidebar, main canvas, window edges, and background effects should feel mathematically intentional.\
Even subtle inconsistencies become highly visible in a minimalist interface because there are fewer elements to distract from them.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec3 Recommendation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec3 Define a small set of layout constants for:\
